##### EXP #####
v 1
fatal: changing a map a loop is over
##### EXIT #####
1
##### ARGS #####
set_present
##### EXP #####
v 1
fatal: changing a map a loop is over
##### EXIT #####
1
##### ARGS #####
remove
##### EXP #####
v 1
fatal: changing a map a loop is over
##### EXIT #####
1
##### ARGS #####
remove_absent
##### EXP #####
v 1
fatal: changing a map a loop is over
##### EXIT #####
1
##### ARGS #####
keys_remove
##### EXP #####
k a
fatal: changing a map a loop is over
##### EXIT #####
1
##### ARGS #####
none
##### EXP #####
